# runall screen-alpine323 --------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Run All. web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23 (OpenRC).$
# As the VM: no PAM, root "!", george in wheel, no ufw, no apk-$
# cron. hardn.yml: george with a key, port 22, two nameservers,$
# backups on, and enableUnattendedUpgrades, enableUfwSshPolicy,$
# configureDns and disableRootSSH true.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured Already as asked$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured Refused$
                           - hardn can't tell which ports SSH...$
  [+] SSH Login            Configured Root login off$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured Nothing asked$
  [ ] SSH Port             Not Configured Already as asked$
  [-] AppArmor             Not Applicable Status only$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured Turn on$
  [ ] DNS                  Not Configured Set 2 nameservers$
  [+] Backups              Configured Used, not changed$
  [-] Environment          Not Applicable Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Plan, review, confirm$
                           [ ] Lockout risk$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

